@startuml
!define RECTANGLE class

RECTANGLE "HTTP Client" as HttpClient {
}

RECTANGLE "host-scanner Service" as HostScanner {
    + HTTP API
    + CNI Directory Resolution Logic
    + JSON Sanitization Logic
    + Provider-Specific Test Support
}

RECTANGLE "Kubernetes Node" as K8sNode {
    + Host Information
    + Filesystem Access (/etc, /run, /var/lib)
    + Container Runtimes (containerd, CRI-O)
    + Kubelet Process
}

RECTANGLE "Test Environment" as TestEnv {
    + End-to-End Tests
    + Unit Tests
    + Go Build Tags
}

HttpClient --> HostScanner : HTTP Requests\n(GET /doesnotexist etc.)
HostScanner --> K8sNode : Collects Host Info,\nAccesses Config Files
HostScanner --> HostScanner : Processes JSON,\nRemoves Secrets
TestEnv --> HostScanner : Validates Behavior\nvia HTTP & Logic Paths

note right of HostScanner
  - Runs as Privileged DaemonSet
  - Exposes HTTP Endpoints
  - Resolves CNI Dir from Runtime Inputs
  - Sanitizes Control-Plane JSON
  - Supports Provider-Specific Testing
end note

note right of K8sNode
  - Provides runtime config files
  - Host-level directories:
    /etc/cni/, /var/lib/cni/
  - Kubelet/containerd/cri-o processes
end note

note right of TestEnv
  - Verifies 404 for unknown endpoints
  - Validates CNI dir resolution
  - Checks secret removal in JSON
  - Uses //go:build <provider> tags
end note

@enduml
